## TERRAFORM

###
# default
###
# Local .terraform directories
**/.terraform/*

# .tfstate files
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

output

# Crash log files
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Exclude all .tfvars and state files containing environment or secret data
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json
*.tfvars
!*.example
!*.tfvars.example
*.tfvars.json
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*local_state.tfstate*
